        <mxCell id="2Det45" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C4110;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;font color=&#39;#5C4110&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PROTOCOLS AND SECURITY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTTPS / TLS 1.3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Browser to FastAPI. The API verifies an OAuth2 / JWT token and the caller&#39;s role before any step is allowed to run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In-process call&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;FastAPI to Orchestrator. No network hop, so nothing to intercept.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTTPS + API key&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agents to Groq. The only outbound internet connection in the system.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Local HTTP (loopback)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ChromaDB to Ollama. Embeddings never leave the host.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;File / SQL, local disk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SQLite. Encrypt at rest and restrict OS file permissions; it holds the audit log.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OTLP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everything to Phoenix, for tracing and cost.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Verify these against your deployment.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="404" width="304" x="78" y="786" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
